</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Rescue me, Lord, from this dark world—it’s just display.</l><l>Shine in me, and show me, Lord, You are the way.</l><l>Nothing matches me but You.</l><l>Only Your life will do.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, cause my love for You to grow in me each day.</l><l>Through this love, show me the world’s passing away.</l><l>Separate me unto You.</l><l>O Lord, my heart renew.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Don’t let me go; I’m here for You and this You know.</l><l>Day by day, Your life within me has to grow.</l><l>Though this world is so corrupt,</l><l>I can and do love You.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O Lord, become a river flowing out of me,</l><l>That the world may take a drink of You and see</l><l>That You are the only way,</l><l>The One reality.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
